Abuse of power, verbal abuse continue annually

&ldquo;Lenient corrective measures ineffective&rdquo;

&nbsp;

Anti-corruption survey shows half of citizens say &ldquo;corrupt&rdquo;

Internal perception among public officials even lower

&ldquo;Patchwork measures won&rsquo;t bring reform&rdquo;



